---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout active="about" title="About — Daily Dad Joke">
  <section class="page-hero about-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="page-kicker label">OUR EXTREMELY SERIOUS MISSION</p>
      <h1>About Daily Dad Joke</h1>
      <p>Making mornings lighter, one questionable punchline at a time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="about-page">
    <section class="about-intro wrap">
      <div class="about-statement">
        <span class="burst-lines" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
        <h2>One joke.<br />Every morning.<br /><span>Zero dignity.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="lead">
          Daily Dad Joke is a tiny daily ritual for people who believe the world
          could use fewer serious notifications and more terrible puns.
        </p>
        <p>
          We publish exactly one fresh, family-friendly joke each morning.
          No endless feed, no doom-scrolling, and no twelve-paragraph setup.
          Just a clean punchline you can share at breakfast, in the group chat,
          or with an unsuspecting coworker.
        </p>
        <p>
          Some jokes are written, some are discovered, and some arrive wearing
          white sneakers with grass stains. Every one is checked for clarity,
          kindness, and the all-important groan factor.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-process">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="section-title">How a groan gets made</h2>
        <div class="process-grid">
          <article class="process-card">
            <span class="step-number label">01</span>
            <h3>Find the setup</h3>
            <p>A familiar situation, a harmless question, and just enough suspense.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="process-card">
            <span class="step-number label">02</span>
            <h3>Polish the pun</h3>
            <p>We trim every extra word until the punchline lands with maximum eye-roll.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="process-card">
            <span class="step-number label">03</span>
            <h3>Release the groan</h3>
            <p>The chosen joke appears on the homepage and joins the archive the next day.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-values wrap">
      <div class="value-item">
        <span class="feature-icon icon-calendar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span>
        <div><h3>Fresh daily</h3><p>A small reason to come back tomorrow.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="value-item">
        <span class="feature-icon icon-shield" aria-hidden="true"><span>♥</span></span>
        <div><h3>Family-friendly</h3><p>Safe for kids, coworkers, and family group chats.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="value-item">
        <span class="feature-icon icon-seal" aria-hidden="true"><span>★</span></span>
        <div><h3>Groan-approved</h3><p>If it earns an eye-roll, it earns a place here.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="label">OUR QUALITY GUARANTEE</p>
        <h2>If you groaned, it worked.</h2>
        <a class="btn btn-navy" href="/">Read today’s joke →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
